# Exclude all compiled output — Docker must build from source.
# Without this, the COPY .. . step in the Dockerfile copies pre-built jars
# into the build context. Maven then sees existing artifacts and may skip
# re-resolving dependencies, so new pom.xml changes (like adding
# springdoc-webflux) are silently ignored in the final image.

**/target/
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/.git/
**/node_modules/
